  "details": "Unity rotation constraints reset the objects rotation if they have a single source with weight 1e-7 or smaller. VRC rotation constraints however still follow the rotation.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MfJ8ZrS9Wto\n\nThis also affects the rotation part of parent constraints as well.\n\nThis affects all my avatars with a world drop as I use a single parent constraint that has a weight of 1e-35 to put a transform at the origin. Those world drops all rotate around the world origin now when I turn ingame instead of staying in place.",
